l  megikula himself far from being nervous  or scared when he comes face to face  with this highest ranking devil nosel is  absolutely psyched for this showdown he  puts all of his strength into one  massive mercury magic attack and he rips  mkikula's body apart using sharp blades  made of mercury as aussie had once told  her son his magic is as tough as steel  and as gentle as water and nosel is able  to use these unique properties of  mercury to attack megicula mercilessly  without allowing her to dodge the  attacks makikula's attempts to defend  herself with blood and steel magic are  completely useless which leaves her in  disbelief but even this merciless attack  by noesel is not enough to defeat  megicula on its own nozelle knows that  he will need help in order to deal the  final blow and that help arrives from  none other than his own sister noel  seeing noelle in action noesel knows  that he was wrong about her instead of  trying to convince her to hide from  danger he should have been working with  her so that the two of them could get  stronger together after an absolutely  fierce onslaught together nozella noel  are able to hack a shocked megicula to  pieces seemingly destroying her entire  body including her evil heart as  megicula's body disintegrates aussie's  essence escapes from the rest of the  crumbling body and she is able to share  one final embrace with her beloved  children as nosel and noel look on with  surprise and with tears in their eyes  ossier tells them how truly strong they  have become and it is clear that she is  extremely proud of her children and that  is how this emotional and shocking  chapter ends megikula has seemingly been  defeated by the combined power of  nozelle and noel and some part of  aussie's essence seems to have survived  the death of her body at least in some  form that is crazy stuff but this is  black clover we're talking about and  tabitha has tricked us multiple times  before so we have to be careful the big  