ery well in a story but for a  badass milf like ossier i'll allow it  let me know what you guys thought about  this emotional chapter is megikula  really gone for good or will she return  in some form if you do think she'll  return do you think that it will be soon  or later on in the arc once the cliff  fought fully opens also what did you  think about the additional aspects of  the silva family history that we learned  in this chapter while i'm definitely  feeling more sympathetic towards noesel  now that i know everything that he had  to go through i still feel so bad for  noel she had to go through so much abuse  over allegedly killing her mother during  her entire childhood but in reality she  had nothing to do with any of it man  that is really tragic and it just makes  me respect noel and her progression so  much more definitely leave your feedback  down in the comments below if you  enjoyed this video and you want to see  more blacklover content in the future  just leave a quick like it only takes a  second but it helps a lot and if you're  new to the channel or maybe you watch  our videos but you haven't taken the  time to subscribe yet do me a quick  favor and make this the video that you  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications you really  have to go through the trouble of  subscribing hitting the bell and then  selecting that option that says all if  you don't do that you're still going to  miss a ton of our videos even if you are  subscribed it's just how youtube works  you can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram at  animeopror i want to give a quick thank  you to all of our anime uproar patrons  who make videos like this one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma he is  an absolute mad lad and disciple of lord  twigo himself and i can't forget all of  our the one tier patrons the ones who  rise above all other clans including  ingrata pate heffa  water the toasted chi the spike dylan  isadore spidey life tinel tu